>How do I get the Amulet and escape to the endlevel?
>(preferably without him chewing my ass all the way there!)

You sense the presence of spoilers.--More--

If you have a cockatrice corpse and a pair of gloves handy, you might
wield the corpse and whack him over the head with it.  If you have a
ring of polymorph control and some method to polymorph yourself, you
might change into a nymph and simply steal the Amulet from him.
Neither of these will keep him from following you, however.

If you throw a potion of paralysis at him, then leave the level before
he recovers, he will be unable to follow you.  Make sure you get the
Amulet first, though.  This feature will probably be taken out of
version 3.1, so don't rely on it too much.

